<title>USA: Citizens Financial Q1 net earnings up.</title>
<headline>Citizens Financial Q1 net earnings up.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended December 31</p>
<p>				 1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net			$48,308    $24,823</p>
<p> Net interest income   136,024     90,939</p>
<p> Noninterest income     65,902     24,871</p>
<p> Noninterest expense   112,400     69,850</p>
<p>	    (All data above 000s)</p>
<p>NOTE: Noninterest expense reflects acquisition of First NH Bank and Farmers and Mechanics Bank.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Citizens Financial Group Inc.</p>
<p>The company is 76.5 percent owned by the Royal Bank of Scotland Group PLC  with the remainder owned by the Bank of Ireland</p>
